BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annual Man Against Horse Race
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261017
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTSTAMP:20261023T154655Z
UID:a61d232598bd000ba95d6d0a@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A bar bet turned into a legendary endurance race. In 1983\, Ma
 n Against Horse began by a bar bet on Whiskey Row in Prescott Arizona betw
 een Gheral Brownlow and Cowboy Steve Rafters. Gheral bet Steve he could ou
 trun his horse in the race. Elevation begins at 5\,000 feet and can climb 
 to an elevation of 7600 ft.\n\nEvent website: https://managainsthorse.com/
 \n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/annual-man-
 against-horse-race
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T154655Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/annual-man-against-horse-race
END:VEVENT
