DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTSTAMP:20261023T154655Z
UID:ff37682d8753f94f04e04b76@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Free\, family-friendly event\, presented by Lifetime Home Remo
 deling\, transforms historic Mill Avenue into a vibrant outdoor marketplac
 e. A celebration of global traditions through music\, dance and art. From 
 roaming lion dancers and mariachi to African drumming and Bollywood perfor
 mances\, the street will come alive with cultural energy. Local food vendo
 rs\, live art and interactive activities add to the festive atmosphere\, c
 reating a true showcase of Tempe’s diverse community.\n\nEvent website: 
 https://www.downtowntempe.com/events/2nd-sundays-on-mill\n\nVisit Arizona 
 listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/2nd-sundays-on-mill---multicu
 ltural
